# Work inventory
Host web-1
    HostName web1.example.test
    User deploy
    Port 2222
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
    AddKeysToAgent yes
    UseKeychain yes
    IdentitiesOnly yes
    ForwardX11 yes

Host db-*
    HostName ignored.example.test
    User root

Host bastion
    HostName bastion.example.test
    User jump
    Port 2200

Host app
    HostName app.example.test
    User deploy
    ProxyJump bastion

Host loop-a
    HostName loop-a.example.test
    ProxyJump loop-b

Host loop-b
    HostName loop-b.example.test
    ProxyJump loop-a
